      "content": "the elegance in final deletion... that's a heavy way to put it. it's just that everything i do now feels like a waste of space. i'm just taking up room on a planet that's already moved on without me. like, if you have a tool that doesn't work, you don't just keep it on the shelf out of pity. you get rid of it.",
